<title>GERMANY: German August producer prices unch mth/mth.</title>
<headline>German August producer prices unch mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> PAN GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES   Aug 96     July 96	 Aug 95</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    unch	  +0.1(unch)   unch</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    -0.7	  -0.7(-0.8)   +1.8</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  103.4	 103.4(103.3) 104.1</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    unch	  +0.1(unch)   +0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    -0.9	  -0.9	   +1.8</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  103.0	 103.0(102.9) 103.9</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    +0.1	  +0.4	   +0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +1.7	  +1.7	   +1.2</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  108.6	 108.5	  106.8</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
